-- a bijection of a finite model commuting with `x □ y = if (M.op a a) = b then a else if (M.op b a) = b then a else (M.op a b)` is an automorphism of `◇` --
is `GuardAut2_pxx_y_pyx_y_x_x_pxy_Equation4416`, proved elsewhere.  That obligation names no target, so every
law the companion satisfies is another cell for free, and there
are 4 of them below.
-/

